    rcap:evidencePosition "lead_in:2" ;
    rcap:evidenceSection "8.3.7" ;
    rcap:evidenceText "Highly effective contraception includes combined (estrogen and progestogen containing) hormonal contraception associated with inhibition of ovulation, progesterone-only contraception association with inhibition of ovulation, intrauterine device, intrauterine hormone-releasing system, bilateral tubal occlusion, vasectomised partner and sexual abstinence." ;
    rcap:occurrenceKind "intervention" .

